      {
        "id": 210417,
        "name": "FearLord",
        "username": "FearLord",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-04T09:52:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would have thought that one of the advantages of having to wait for a completed product to be printed and shipped is plenty of time to work on the digital content. From the sound of things, everything in the 2 mini packs has been complete for quite a while, so hopefully they’ll be ready relatively quickly after the physical stuff is all delivered, with a fair chunk of time to work on the OlivAeon stuff - I imagine it will be several months at the earliest before anyone starts to get anything, and I imagine the digital releases will be at least a little staggered?</p>",
