        "created_at": "2018-01-04T13:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>H Keep in mind with Celestial Tribunal you have the wrench of Representative of Earth thrown in. &nbsp; Which means in those games they have to account for every Character Card that is available. &nbsp;So even without the new OblivAeon heroes that card alone requires a lot of extra coding I imagine. &nbsp;</p>",
